-- First canvas piece: a 1080 by 1350 post, chrome headline on red enamel.
create a canvas called post, 1080 by 1350.

write "SALE" called headline in Lilita One, at 540 620, size 380.
write "THIS WEEKEND ONLY" called sub in Martian Mono, at 540 820, size 44.
draw a circle called badge, 220 big, at 900 170.
write "50" called pct in Lilita One, at 900 192, size 130.

on the front.
enamel the card in #a8141d.
emboss the headline, 0.2 mm high, soft 0.6.
plate the headline with chrome.
emboss the badge, 0.12 mm high.
plate the badge with gold.
engrave the pct, 0.05 mm deep.
inlay the pct with #a8141d, 0.02 mm deep.
engrave the sub, 0.03 mm deep.
inlay the sub with #f4e3b0, 0.02 mm deep.
spray the card with gloss, 30 µm thick.
